# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of OS or local
# core.autocrlf settings. Without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF while
# the committed blobs are LF, and a script run on Windows (which, by
# default, also writes new text/CSV/JSON files with CRLF) silently
# produces byte-different output from what's committed — making every
# `git status` show the whole repo as "modified" and making
# scripts/publish_gate.py's reproducibility check fail on a false
# positive. See docs/LIMITATIONS.md item 13.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
